            },
            "reviewBody": "I have gluten issues and altered this recipe for GF buckwheat pancakes - adding the wild rice to them gave them a whole new and pleasant flavor - thanks for the idea"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
