            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jerry Maule"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made these pancakes for breakfast this morning and they were excellent. This recipe is definitely a keeper! The only things I did different was increase the rice to 1 1/2 cups and only used 1 tablespoon of sugar as I’m not a sweets person. Thank you for sharing this awesome recipe!",
